Package: rclone
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf i386
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: ca-certificates, fuse | fuse3
Description: rsync for cloud storage
 Rclone is a program to sync files and directories between the local
 file system and a variety of cloud storage providers,
 including (but not limited to):
 .
  - Google Drive
  - Amazon S3 and S3-compatible providers
  - Dropbox
  - Google Cloud Storage
  - Microsoft OneDrive and SharePoint
  - Backblaze B2
  - Openstack Swift
  - SFTP, FTP, WebDAV, HTTP
 .
 It can also mount any remote as a filesystem, serve remotes over several
 protocols, check and repair transfers with checksums, and copy or sync
 directly between two remotes without staging data locally.
